# Gravis Finance Smart Contract Audit Reports

## Overview

This folder contains historical public smart contract audit materials completed by Softstack for Gravis Finance.

Gravis Finance is included in Softstack’s public audit archive as a DeFi and farming smart contract security reference.

## Audit Information

Project: Gravis Finance  
Audit type: DeFi farm and protocol smart contract audit  
Repository category: Historical public audit archive  
Public report status: Available in this folder  
Project status: Public activity may have changed after audit completion  

